6c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32zm128-64V320c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32s-32-14.3-32-32V160c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32s32 14.3 32 32zm64 32c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32v96c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32s-32-14.3-32-32V224c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32zM480 96V320c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32s-32-14.3-32-32V96c0-17.7 14.3-32 32-32s32 14.3 32 32z"> </path></svg></div><div class="flex-grow-1 ms-2"><a target="_blank" class="accordion-button" href="/horizon/outlook/consumer-network-attached-storage-market/uae"><p class="recent_public_media_stats mb-0 text-limit-2 lh-base font-s-14">UAE Consumer Network Attached Storage Market Outlook</p></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-9 col-md-8"><div class="row position-relative"><div class="col-xxl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 mb-md-4 mb-3"><div class="card card-border mb-0 "><div class="card-body position-relative h-480p pt-   overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden text_padding_lt"><div><div class="position-relative reading_full_box over_tbl "><div><h2>U.S. consumer network attached storage market highlights</h2><ul><li><span>The U.S. consumer network attached storage market generated a revenue of USD 1,704.5 million in 2025 and is expected to reach USD 4,096.9 million by 2033.</span></li><li><span>The U.S. market is expected to grow at a CAGR of 11.5% from 2026 to 2033.</span></li><li><span>In terms of segment, 4-bays was the largest revenue generating design in 2025.</span></li><li><span>2-Bays is the most lucrative design segment registering the fastest growth during the forecast period.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><h3>Consumer network attached storage market data book summary</h3><div class="d-flex justify-content-left ms-8"><table class="table table-striped table-bordered table_hover rounded"><tbody><tr><td>Market revenue in 2025</td><td>USD 1,704.5 million</td></tr><tr><td>Market revenue in 2033</td><td>USD 4,096.9 million</td></tr><tr><td>Growth rate</td><td>11.5% (CAGR from 2026 to 2033)</td></tr><tr><td>Largest segment</td><td>4-bays</td></tr><tr><td>Fastest growing segment</td><td>2-Bays</td></tr><tr><td>Historical data</td><td>2021 - 2024</td></tr><tr><td>Base year</td><td>2025</td></tr><tr><td>Forecast period</td><td>2026 - 2033</td></tr><tr><td>Quantitative units</td><td>Revenue in USD million</td></tr><tr><td>Market segmentation</td><td>4-Bays, Above 6-Bays, 2-Bays, 1-Bay, 5-Bays, 6-Bays</td></tr><tr><td>Key market players worldwide</td><td>D-Link, Dell Technologies Inc Ordinary Shares - Class C, NEC Corp, Asustek Computer Inc DR, Netgear Inc, Seagate Technology Holdings PLC, Western Digital Corp, QNAP, Synology, ZyXEL, TerraMaster</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br></p><h3>Other key industry trends</h3><ul class="second_ul"><li>In terms of revenue, U.S. accounted for 24.5% of the global consumer network attached storage market in 2025.</li><li>Country-wise, U.S. is expected to lead the global market in terms of revenue in 2033.</li><li>In North America, U.S. consumer network attached storage market is projected to lead the regional market in terms of revenue in 2033.</li><li>Canada is the fastest growing regional market in North America and is projected to reach USD 1,248.7 million by 2033.</li></ul><br></div></div><div class="my-2"><hr class="w-40"/><p>Key Regions:<a class="ms-1" href="/horizon/outlook/consumer-network-attached-storage-market/united-states"><span class="text_underline">U.S.</span>, </a><a class="ms-1" href="/horizon/outlook/consumer-network-attached-storage-market/uk"><span class="text_underline">UK</span>, </a><a class="ms-1" href="/horizon/outlook/consumer-network-attached-storage-market/japan"><span class="text_underline">Japan</span>, </a><a class="ms-1" href="/horizon/outlook/consumer-network-attached-storage-market/brazil"><span class="text_underline">Brazil</span>, </a><a class="ms-1" href="/horizon/outlook/consumer-network-attached-storage-market/uae"><span class="text_underline">UAE</span></a></p></div><div class="row justify-content-center pb-2"><div class="