 of the revenue is generated working with academic and research not-for-profit institutes. We do our bit of pro-bono by working with these institutions at subsidized rates.</div></div></li></ul><p class="mb-2 segment-li-sub">Horizon Databook provides a detailed overview of<!-- --> <!-- -->country-level<!-- --> <!-- -->data and insights on the <!-- -->U.S. Consumer Network Attached Storage Market Outlook<!-- -->, including forecasts for subscribers. This<!-- --> <!-- -->country<!-- --> <!-- -->databook contains high-level insights into <!-- -->U.S. Consumer Network Attached Storage Market Outlook<!-- --> from<!-- --> <!-- -->2021<!-- --> to <!-- -->2033<!-- -->, including revenue numbers, major trends, and company profiles.<!-- --> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></div><div class="row position-relative"><div class="col-xxl-12 col-lg-12 col-md-12 mb-md-4 mb-3"><div class="card card-border mb-0 "><div class="card-header card-header-action border-bottom-0 chart_header d-block d-lg-flex"><h3 class="m-0 font-s-17 mnh-50p w-70 fw-semibold text_purple2 mb-2 mb-lg-0">U.S. Consumer Network Attached Storage Market, 2021-2033 (US$M)</h3><div class="card-action-wrap"><div class="w-290p"><div class="dropdown-hover dropdown ex-btn"><a aria-disabled="false" href="#" role="button" aria-expanded="false" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm font-s-14 mr-5 fr fw-semibold py-2_5 dropdown-toggle ">Download<div class="dropdown-filter-arrow-download"></div></a><div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end mt-7 w-275p border-primary border px-3 py-3"><ul><li class="bg_purple2 rounded py-1 px-2 text-black">Select file type</li><ul class="ms-2"><li class="mt-1"><a role="button" class="dropdown-item font-s-14" type="button" title="Download as PNG"><span class="ms-2 mb-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="1" viewBox="0 0 16 16" height="