u003e\u003ctd\u003e2021 - 2024\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eBase year\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eForecast period\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2026 - 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eQuantitative units\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRevenue in USD million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket segmentation\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e4-Bays, Above 6-Bays, 2-Bays, 1-Bay, 5-Bays, 6-Bays\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eKey market players worldwide\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eD-Link, Dell Technologies Inc Ordinary Shares - Class C, NEC Corp, Asustek Computer Inc DR, Netgear Inc, Seagate Technology Holdings PLC, Western Digital Corp, QNAP, Synology, ZyXEL, TerraMaster\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eOther key industry trends\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul class=\"second_ul\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn terms of revenue, U.S. accounted for 24.5% of the global consumer network attached storage market in 2025.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCountry-wise, U.S. is expected to lead the global market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn North America, U.S. consumer network attached storage market is projected to lead the regional market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCanada is the fastest growing regional market in North America and is projected to reach USD 1,248.7 million by 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"])</script><script type="1ad71a30b6bb37b5659993df-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"outlookData\":{\"report\":{\"_id\":\"6a8ea567e61fd6caaaf02e8c\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-26T08:35:51.989Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T08:35:51.989Z\",\"report_id\":\"65eadf87b3b6be30bc066367\",\"name\":\"Consumer Network Attached Storage Market Outlook\",\"full_name\":\"Con